{"id":"deff01c69d99418f","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-schnorr-trivial-missing-ce-degree.md","title":"不含Schnorr平凡集的可枚举度","display":"thm-schnorr-trivial-missing-ce-degree — 不含Schnorr平凡集的可枚举度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-schnorr-trivial-missing-ce-degree","aliases":["43-thm-schnorr-trivial-missing-ce-degree"],"display":"thm-schnorr-trivial-missing-ce-degree — 不含Schnorr平凡集的可枚举度","depends_on":["[[43-df-schnorr-trivial]]","[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Cor.16.3.9, printed p.498 / PDF p.518; Thm.16.3.4 and proof printed pp.494–498 / PDF pp.514–518","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-schnorr-trivial-missing-ce-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-schnorr-trivial-missing-ce-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-schnorr-trivial-missing-ce-degree — 不含Schnorr平凡集的可枚举度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"84713a230dd071da\" href=\"?note=84713a230dd071da\" title=\"43-df-schnorr-trivial\">43-df-schnorr-trivial</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Cor.16.3.9, printed p.498 / PDF p.518; Thm.16.3.4 and proof printed pp.494–498 / PDF pp.514–518"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T\">\\(\\equiv_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"84713a230dd071da\" href=\"?note=84713a230dd071da\" title=\"43-df-schnorr-trivial\">43-df-schnorr-trivial</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\,[\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\,(B\\equiv_TA\\Rightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}(B))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\,[\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\,(B\\equiv_TA\\Rightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}(B))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>量词覆盖该度的全部代表元，不仅是c.e.代表元。这里只采用原书明确的推论16.3.9；没有照录紧前16.3.4中关于“all c.e. machines”的可疑草稿措辞。推论陈述已核对，完整优先构造尚未独立重验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-schnorr-trivial","status":"resolved","id":"84713a230dd071da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorr-trivial]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B$ 遍历 $\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$；$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]，$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[43-df-turing-red]]，$\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}$ 见 [[43-df-schnorr-trivial]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B$ 遍历 $\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$；$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]，$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[43-df-turing-red]]，$\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}$ 见 [[43-df-schnorr-trivial]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorr-trivial","status":"resolved","id":"84713a230dd071da","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B$ 遍历 $\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$；$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]，$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[43-df-turing-red]]，$\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}$ 见 [[43-df-schnorr-trivial]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}","display":false